  "worked_solution": "Notice that $Y$ can be obtained from $X$ by swapping the $2$nd and the $3$rd rows. \n\nThis changes the sign of the determinant to the opposite one.\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(Y) & =-det(X) \\\\  & =-(14) \\\\  & =-14.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
